{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qXKJmFbHGv1794813945.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產馬鞍山迎海御峰分行資深區域營業經理胡耀祖表示，近日交投氣氛向好，西沙Sierra sea本月暫錄約23宗二手成交，屋苑最新錄2A期5座中層B室，實用面積457平方呎，2房間隔，開價約750萬元，議價後以710萬元易手，實用平均呎價15,536元。<br/>中原胡耀祖指，新買家為用家，見單位間隔合用，價錢合理，即決定入市單位自用。據了解，原業主於2026年2月以537萬元購入單位，持貨約9個月，是次轉手賬面上獲利173萬元或32.2%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:23:56.425415+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T02:17:13.302290+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:17:16.277323+00:00","content_hash":"c287fcf16da78f4c27c9f522553d2ffbf6eccbd15181f23affb4171eeca09b71","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:23:56.425415+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}